OL,3,GNEWSAShane Richie pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Adrink-driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FEastEnders actor Shane Richie has
OL,7,Fpleaded not guilty to a single charge
OL,8,Fof drink-driving.
OL,10,FThe 62-year-old, who has played Alfie
OL,11,FMoon in the BBC soap on and off since
OL,12,F2002, was arrested at a petrol station
OL,13,Fin Harlow, Essex, on 29 July where he
OL,14,Fwas with his Hyundai IX35.
OL,16,FRichie, from Tadworth in Surrey, has
OL,17,Fappeared at Colchester Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt via video link from a hotel room.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
