OL,3,GNEWSAShane Richie pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Adrink-driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe actor - who appeared under his real
OL,7,Fname of Shane Roche - spoke only to
OL,8,Fconfirm his name, address and plea. He
OL,9,Fis next due to appear for trial at the
OL,10,Fsame court on 17 November 2027.
